  {manual 6.181}; -hex8 is an input error in the GNU. The Professional
  02-08-2026 takes any other name as -prism18 [DIVERGENCES
  EXTRUDE-ELEMENT-NAME].
  EXPECTED_ERROR: Error: control_mesh_extrude_element must be -prism18 or -prism12. )
